{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q34", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "命主的两名小孩在哪一年出生？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，喜木火为用。年柱庚申、月柱乙酉、日柱丁酉，时柱乙巳，时支巳火为日主之根，但整体金气过重，需木火生扶。\n\n命主为女性，以食伤（土）为子女星。八字中土星不显，需看大运流年引动。命主1980年出生，当前（假设为2023年）行至中年，需结合大运推算子女出生年份。\n\n命主日支酉为偏财，时支巳中藏戊土伤官（子女星），但藏而不透。大运方面，若行至木火运，则利于子女。根据常见推算，命主在2013-2015年间可能行至甲申或癸未运，其中未土为食神，可引动子女星。2013年癸巳，巳火助身，且巳中戊土伤官透出，可能生女；2015年乙未，未土为食神，亦可能生女。而2017丁酉、2019己亥，金水旺，不利子女星，且两男孩可能性低。2020庚子、2021辛丑，金水更旺，且子女星不显，可能性小。\n\n综合判断，命主子女出生年份更可能在2013年和2015年，且均为女孩，符合选项B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q34", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5053, "response_id": "4010b8fc-0e00-4d08-9d75-310df8e25432", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 325, "total_tokens": 561, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q35", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主毕业后从事什么行业？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析：\n\n1. **日主丁火**，生于酉月（金旺），地支两酉一申，金气极重，火弱需印比帮扶。时柱乙巳，乙木生丁火，巳火为根，但巳酉半合金局，火势被泄，整体身弱。\n\n2. **用神取木火**（印比），忌金水。月干乙木偏印透出，时干乙木亦为偏印，印星贴身，主学业、文化、教育之象。偏印旺者，多与知识、学术、技术相关。\n\n3. **官杀（金）过旺**，代表压力、规则、管理，但身弱不担官杀，不宜从事高压管理或竞争激烈行业（如公司主管、房屋经纪）。财星（金）亦旺，但身弱财多，易为财所累，会计虽属财，但需精细，且金为忌，不利。\n\n4. **印星为用**，且透干，最宜教育、文化、文职类。丁火为灯烛之火，有照亮他人之象，教师正合此象。且乙木偏印为柔木，主文科、语言，中学教师符合。\n\n综合判断，命主最可能从事教育行业。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q35", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5256, "response_id": "4fabad11-dfd1-431b-999d-af1fda6ac2d2", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 288, "total_tokens": 493, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 77}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q36", "domain": "health", "question": "请问命主在一岁前被诊断出那一种疾病？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，命主日主为乙木，生于丑月（冬季末），木气衰弱。年柱丙戌，月柱辛丑，时柱庚辰，天干透出辛金、庚金，地支丑、戌、辰皆为土，土重金旺，木被克耗严重。乙木在命局中无强根，且被金土围困，代表肝胆、筋骨或神经系统方面易有先天不足。\n\n一岁前（即婴儿期）对应大运尚未起运，以月柱辛丑为用。辛金为七杀，丑土为湿土，金旺克木，且丑中藏癸水（偏印）但被土克制，水不养木。命局中火（丙）虽透但被土晦，火主心脏、血液，火弱则心脏功能可能偏弱。同时，乙木为阴木，对应人体经络、筋脉，金克木易导致眼部或神经问题。\n\n结合选项：\n- 弱视（斗鸡眼）多与肝木受克、目窍失养有关，但命局中火弱更明显。\n- 心脏有孔属先天性心脏病，与火（心）受克、土重晦火相关，且婴儿期金旺克木，木不生火，火气更衰。\n- 肺炎属呼吸系统，金主肺，但金旺不一定直接导致肺炎，且土多生金，肺气过旺反而不易病。\n- 地中海贫血症属血液病，与火（血）相关，但命局中火弱且被晦，更符合心脏问题。\n\n综合判断，火（心）受克最重，且婴儿期火气最弱，心脏有孔的可能性最大。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q36", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6640, "response_id": "95d1f12b-3468-45d1-ac99-abef95728599", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 382, "total_tokens": 599, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q37", "domain": "wealth", "question": "此命主的出身贫或富？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。年柱丙戌，丙火透出为用，但戌土为燥土，火有根但受制。月柱辛丑，辛金七杀克身，丑土湿土晦火，财星旺而身弱。时柱庚辰，庚金正官合身，辰土为湿土，进一步耗木。整体来看，命局财官过旺，日主身弱，需印比帮扶，但八字中木火之力不足，仅年干丙火为用，但被月干辛金合绊，用神受损。早年行运（1-10岁）为庚子运，子水虽生木，但与原局丑土合土，反而加重财星，且庚金官星克身，家境一般，无大富之象。综合判断，命主出身应为普通家庭，经济条件中等，符合“小康之家”的特征。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q37", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3783, "response_id": "7cd72228-f519-40e2-aebc-82674168773e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 222, "total_tokens": 439, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月（冬季末），木气偏寒且土旺（月柱辛丑、日支丑、时支辰均为土），乙木坐丑土为“财星”且被土耗，木根不深。年柱丙戌火土相生，但丙火被辛金合绊，火势不强，无法充分温暖乙木。时柱庚辰，庚金正官克乙木，金旺木弱。\n\n从五行与身形看，乙木为阴木，主柔韧、修长，但土重木折，木气受制，故身材不会高瘦（排除A）。金旺克木，木主肝胆、筋骨，金主骨骼，金旺则骨骼偏大，但木弱则肌肉不丰，整体可能偏壮实而非魁梧（排除B）。土多主皮肤偏黄或暗沉，木弱则五官不够立体，且乙木被土金所困，气质偏于平凡（排除C的“蜡黄”和“其貌不扬”有一定符合，但“矮瘦”不准确，因为土多主敦实）。时柱庚辰，辰为水库，土湿，日主乙木得微根于辰（辰中藏乙），但整体土重，易有微胖倾向，且乙木柔顺，圆脸和善更符合土旺之象。\n\n综合判断，命主身材偏矮微胖，圆脸，外表和善，符合D的描述。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6691, "response_id": "066e579d-529a-4a35-821f-54af64edd020", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 252, "completion_tokens": 331, "total_tokens": 583, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 124}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q39", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2016年，家中发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱丙戌，月柱辛丑，日柱乙丑，时柱庚辰。日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，喜水木为用，忌土金。\n\n2016年为丙申年。流年天干丙火为伤官，地支申金为正官。申金与命局中月支丑、日支丑形成申丑相合（申中庚金合丑中己土，但实际为申丑暗合），同时申金与年支戌土有半会金局之势（申戌拱酉，金气增强）。流年丙火伤官透出，与月干辛金七杀相合（丙辛合水），但水被土克，合而不化，反而引发金木交战。\n\n大运方面，命主2016年虚岁10岁，正行第一步大运（约2007-2016年）为庚子运。庚金为正官，子水为偏印。但2016年流年申金，与运支子水形成申子半合水局，水势增强，本可生木，但命局土重，水被土阻，且流年申金冲克日主乙木之根（申中庚金克乙木），木受伤严重。\n\n综合判断：2016年丙申年，金旺克木，木主肝胆、四肢，也代表父亲（偏财为父，但此局以正财为父星，丑中己土为父，但被申金合动）。申金为驿马，又为七杀之根，七杀主意外、血光。流年丙火伤官与七杀相合，伤官合杀，主突发灾祸。且申金冲克日主，日主乙木弱，易有血光之灾。结合选项，最符合“父亲严重车祸，休养在家，无法工作”的象——金旺克木，车祸伤及肢体，且申金为驿马，主出行意外。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q39", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6686, "response_id": "b85f4e68-52cd-4b7b-86ef-cebe3917a9da", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 447, "total_tokens": 674, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q40", "domain": "family", "question": "命主父亲现在的身家？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。年柱丙戌，丙火透出为用，但戌土为燥土，火有根但被丑土晦火。月柱辛丑，七杀辛金克身，丑土财星旺。时柱庚辰，正官庚金合身，辰土为湿土，财官过重。整体命局财官旺而身弱，喜木火帮身。\n\n命主父亲看偏财（月干辛金为七杀，偏财看年干丙火，但丙火被辛金合，且戌土为火库，但被丑土冲晦）。丙火为偏财，坐戌土有根，但被月干辛金合绊，且丑戌相刑，财星受损。时柱庚辰，正官合身，父亲可能为公职或稳定职业，但财星受制，难以大富。\n\n结合马来西亚环境，丙火偏财被合，且丑戌刑，财库有损，父亲财运中等偏下，但命主出生时丙戌年，火土旺，父亲应有稳定收入，但非巨富。综合判断，小康家庭可能性最大。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q40", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5217, "response_id": "6fe56acd-5d68-4972-a563-d05a67ac2d0b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 277, "total_tokens": 496, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
